 till the toilet.\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c27271"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"水泳部の女の子。体にフィットした競泳水着姿目当ての男子からの人気があるが、さっぱりしていてボーイッシュな性格から女子の人気も高い。泳ぎは速いが息継ぎで水を飲み込んでしまう癖がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その為なのか、トイレが近いのが悩み。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8357","sourceWorkId":"21104","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"水泳が得意な ボーイッシュ女子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体にフィットした競泳水着を着ており、それ目当てに集まる男子が多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一方、さっぱりしている性格から、女子からの人気も高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"泳ぎは早いが、息継ぎで水を飲んでしまう癖がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのためなのか、トイレが近いのが悩み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「この間は、体調がおかしくて、トイレまでオシッコ我慢できなかったよ……。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"110847"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"110847","value":"水泳、花火"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8357","sourceWorkId":"21104","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8357","sourceWorkId":"21104","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"153 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8357","sourceWorkId":"21104","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8357","sourceWorkId":"21104","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8357","sourceWorkId":"21104","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/26da63413a911e8ac2a746fda0fcd1ccb4e0e8952c0299e65e87ee6b7d004562.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/17/17e0ed602368deeddb51b59b1cb441869a17108ea25b55edbd32ffc6de97c77f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"cre